Third-party components
----------------------

The following are build-time dependencies only. They are not vendored in this
repository; CMake downloads the headers when system copies are not used.

- Vulkan-Headers (Khronos Group)
  License: Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/KhronosGroup/Vulkan-Headers

- OpenVR SDK header, openvr.h (Valve Corporation)
  License: BSD-3-Clause
  https://github.com/ValveSoftware/openvr

The layer loads libopenvr_api.so at runtime with dlopen; that library is
provided by the installed SteamVR runtime and is not redistributed here.
